   'icon, a bookmark icon and simple tool icons. Do not show any app screen, dashboard, device, menu, '
   'server list or interface, and no on-screen words other than the captions and a final card reading '
   'OU1COMES and www.outcomes.services. Use three beats. Start with a strong opening line, keep the '
