   'Before you connect an MCP server, see what it can actually do. Explore capabilities on OU1COMES. www.outcomes.services #MCP #AIagents #AI'),

  ('OU1COMES: Start from the outcome', NULL, 'LIVE - OWN PRODUCT', NULL, 'Promotion', 103, 'pending',
   'A short vertical TikTok promotional video for Outcomes, a website at www.outcomes.services. '
